{
  "_comment": [
    "Which Bitwarden Secrets Manager secret each NAME resolves to, by UUID.",
    "bitwarden/sm-action fetches by UUID, never by name, so without this file every",
    "workflow would carry raw UUIDs and be unreadable. .github/actions/bws-secrets",
    "reads it to translate NAME -> UUID at job start; check_bws_map.py asserts every",
    "name a workflow requests exists here, and that this record is not stale.",
    "Refresh: scripts/ops/bws-map-refresh.py (needs bws on PATH and BWS_ACCESS_TOKEN).",
    "Names here are the Part 10 target spellings as of 2026-09-02; the rename moved",
    "only the NAME column -- every UUID is the one the secret was created with."
  ],
